# A low-contrast platform: the effective index sits close to the cladding.
# Reference: SciPy root of the dispersion relation.
title 600 nm silicon nitride slab in oxide
stack core=0.6
materials core=sin
grating angle=10 etch=0.3
sweep 1.45 1.65 201
expect n_full 1.83309860 2e-07
expect n_etched 1.67370600 2e-07
expect n_grating 1.75340230 2e-07
expect group_index 2.00671450 0.0002
